  "mainEntity": {
    "name": "Is HH Remodeling LLC the Right Fit for Your Bathroom Waterproofing Project?",
    "text": "Is HH Remodeling LLC the Right Fit for Your Bathroom Waterproofing Project?",
    "@type": "Question",
    "answerCount": 1,
    "acceptedAnswer": {
      "text": "Is HH Remodeling LLC the right choice for your bathroom waterproofing project? If you want an owner-operated general contractor who stays directly involved on your job site, the answer is yes. Founded in 2017 and maintaining an A+ rating with the Better Business Bureau, HH Remodeling LLC provides hands-on remodeling and restoration work across Aurora and the Denver metro area.\n\nOwner Abraham Becerra serves as your primary contact and on-site lead, managing substrate preparation, framing adjustments, drywall, and finish tile installation. Because waterproofing failures happen when trade handoffs fail, having an experienced lead contractor oversee both the moisture barrier and the finished stone prevents penetrations from being overlooked. Whether you are remodeling a classic bathroom, updating a walk-in shower, or repairing prior water damage, HH Remodeling LLC provides clear communication and careful attention to moisture management.\n\nWhat Can Change the Right Choice:\nIf you need extensive specialized plumbing relocations or structural wall alterations, Abraham coordinates trusted trades while keeping finish quality and moisture detailing under direct supervision.\n\nWhat to Do Next:\nProtect your home from hidden leaks with professional waterproofing and remodeling. Call Abraham Becerra at HH Remodeling LLC at 303-505-0866 to discuss your bathroom plans and schedule a consultation.",
      "@type": "Answer",
      "author": {
        "name": "HH Remodeling LLC",
        "@type": "Organization"
      }
    }
  }
